Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.76,0:02:12.96,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1299,465)\fad(300,300)}Corpse Sect\NCountry of Zhao
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:24.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where are you from ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.32,0:02:27.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,A rank 2 country.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:29.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm Li San from the sect's branch in the country of Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:31.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm here for the promotion test.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:33.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,18th cave on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Looks like a Senior is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:47.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:53.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Wang Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please inform Ancestor Ye Zizai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:02:58.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I have urgent matters to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:02.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who activated our Corpse Sect's formation for you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.04,0:03:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Ancestor Ye !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:12.56,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(403,515)\fad(300,300)}Ye Zizai\NCorpse Sect Ancestor\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:35.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for delivering the message, Junior Wang Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of Junior Brother Wu Yu's situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:39.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since he requested,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:42.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,would you like to join our Corpse Sect ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:43.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since I'm here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:45.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I could use this chance to cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:47.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple agrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:50.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you're fated with Junior Brother Wu Yu,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,then you are his disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:54.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:57.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're a core disciple of the Corpse Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:03:59.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will take care of Adai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:04.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since he was a friend of Junior Brother Wu Yu,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:06.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I'll personally take him as my disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:10.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:19.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,He knows Wu Yu is in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,but doesn't seem worried by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.60,0:04:23.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think Wu Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,trusted the wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Mu Rong
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:35.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,pays respects to Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:39.12,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(302,553)\fad(300,300)}Mu Rong\NCorpse Sect Elder\NLate stage\NFoundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:38.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're an Elder,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:39.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,no need for formalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.52,0:04:43.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor Ye arranged a cultivation cave for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:44.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me guide you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:01.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle, focus on cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once you reach Middle stage Foundation Establishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:06.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,use the Corpse Sect's cultivation method you were given
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:08.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then you can come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.16,0:05:21.68,Earth Yin,,0,0,0,,{\pos(981,681)\fad(300,000)}Grade 10\NEarth Yin
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:21.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,A grade 10 Earth Yin spot !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.68,0:05:23.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wu Yu didn't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:26.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place is perfect for the Underworld Ascension Method.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:37.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1476,523)\fad(300,300)}Luo Sha\NYe Zizai's Corpse Puppet\NLate stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:37.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Junior Brother left too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:41.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,He left before Lord Zi's Divine Sense awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:44.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Foolishly, he asked you for help,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:47.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,setting himself up for a trap !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that we know where he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's hurry and help Lord Zi devour Wu Yu !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.76,0:05:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Luo Sha, you haven't finished devouring me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:59.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't order me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then, you were so proud when
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.24,0:06:04.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,the both of you obtained me and Lord Zi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.64,0:06:06.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,as your Corpse Puppets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you never imagined that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.56,0:06:14.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,these Corpse Puppets were already seeded with our Divine Sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your entire Corpse Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.76,0:06:20.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,is just a market selling bodies for cultivators that lost their body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Adai's body is excellent,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.68,0:06:31.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,you should try possessing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:33.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,How will you deal with that brat
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:35.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,named Wang Lin ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:37.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:41.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Foreign Battlefield cleanup is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:44.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will receive our token in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:49.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once the Cultivation Alliance's envoy opens the portal
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only need to absorb 3 breaths of spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:55.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,to finish my possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's here !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why did it gain 2 leaf symbols ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could there be wood element energy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.16,0:07:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Save me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:28.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Save me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.40,0:07:33.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Save me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the reason
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:41.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Corpse Sect is an extreme Yin energy gathering spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.56,0:07:44.39,Second,,0,0,0,,Save me... Save me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:47.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,His cultivation is above Nascent Soul !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:47.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Save me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:49.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, Junior is not powerful enough to h...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:50.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Save me !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:03.36,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(444,471)\fad(300,300)}Heaven's Tower\NCountry of Zhao
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.84,0:08:09.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's already been 500 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:12.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,If not for our Huangquan Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:13.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,taking a liking to Zhao,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Cultivation Alliance wouldn't have built Heaven's Tower here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you guys would never have entered the Foreign Battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.16,0:08:26.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, you're still my Corpse Puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.28,0:08:29.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lord Envoy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:31.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ye Zizai of the Corpse Sect pays respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:36.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,No need for formalities, Ye Zizai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:38.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're old acquaintances.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:41.56,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(411,511)\fad(300,300)}Lin Yi\NHeaven's Tower Envoy\NEarly stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,In just a few years
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:44.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,your Corpse Puppet has reached Late stage Nascent Soul !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:48.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You flatter me, Envoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.52,0:08:51.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could the Joyful Union Sect miss this event ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Piao Nanzi of the Xuan Dao Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.72,0:08:59.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,greets fellow cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:02.84,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1620,498)\fad(300,300)}Chen Huan\NFounder of the Joyful Union Sect\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:02.84,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(332,498)\fad(300,300)}Chen Yan\NFounder of the Joyful Union Sect\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:00.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Piao Nanzi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:03.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard you destroyed the Heng Yue Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.24,0:09:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is it true ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.20,0:09:07.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:10.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of the Heng Yue Sect Ancestors are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:14.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Piao Nanzi, you just took advantage of their weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:19.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did fellow cultivators covet Heng Yue Mountain too ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:23.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a pity I was faster than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:23.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:28.56,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(895,472)\fad(150,000)}Wu Qinfeng\NWufeng Valley Ancestor\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:28.56,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1647,631)\fad(150,000)}Gao Qiming\NPiao Miao Sect Ancestor\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.56,0:09:29.72,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(466,583)}Yun Mei\NTiandao Sect Ancestor\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.56,0:09:29.72,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1648,629)}Zhi Yi\NTiandao Sect Ancestor\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:33.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the Nascent Soul cultivators of Zhao are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Lord Envoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:42.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,this once in 500 years opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:43.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,will soon begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.36,0:09:45.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The country of Zhao is responsible
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:49.51,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: 1 li = 150m
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:49.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,for clearing 100 000 squared li at 58 degrees north of the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:54.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the high-grade artifacts collected
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,will belong to your respective sects.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:00.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lord Envoy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:03.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,how will the battle of Jue Ming Valley proceed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:05.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The rules of the Cultivation Alliance
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:09.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,say that only 3 sects from Zhao may enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.72,0:10:12.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this battle between you is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Same old rules:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,only Foundation Establishment disciples may fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nascent Soul and Core Formation cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.40,0:10:21.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:35.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a terrifying pressure !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:37.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this Soul Transformation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:39.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Nascent Soul can't endure this !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.52,0:10:44.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lin Yi, envoy of a rank 5 cultivation country
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:47.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,welcomes the Envoy of the Cultivation Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.72,0:10:47.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(331,505)\fad(300,300)}\NEnvoy of the Cultivation Alliance\NGiant Demon Clan member\NLate stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:55.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The spiritual energy here is trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:58.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not even worth breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is an envoy from the Giant Demon Clan !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:07.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this the power of the Giant Demon Clan ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:11.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Envoy, why did the Alliance send you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pay attention to these words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.48,0:11:17.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,In 3 months,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,the gate will open.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,If any of you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:25.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,happens to find a bead like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.96,0:11:27.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:30.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you hand it over,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:32.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will be rewarded with a Soul Transformation artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:37.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if you dare to hide it from me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:41.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will destroy your country of Zhao
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:43.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and kill all of you !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.80,0:11:51.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lin Yi, I'm taking your 7-colored lotus artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:55.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:02.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the Jue Ming Valley battle
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:05.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,there will be 7 jade tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.40,0:12:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,At least 4 must be crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:10.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will meet at the entrance of the valley in 7 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:12.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The sects that have a token
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:14.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,are allowed to enter the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:17.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,We follow your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, fellow cultivator Qiming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:26.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have a request for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:35.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:39.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Ancestor summoned all Foundation Establishment disciples to Cave 36.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm here to accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:53.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:12:57.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally, I get to kill people !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:12:59.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect chance to cultivate my Corpse Puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:02.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:04.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Aside from Mu Rong at Late stage
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.44,0:13:07.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,all the others just reached Foundation Establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:12.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.68,0:13:17.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The battle of Jue Ming Valley is critical.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:20.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are the Corpse Sect's finest disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.20,0:13:24.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must fight hard to keep our sect's token.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,In Jue Ming Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:29.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will follow Mu Rong's lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:31.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here is our sect's token.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:33.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.16,0:13:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone's Soul Blood
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:38.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,was already collected in these jades
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:40.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,except for one person...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.76,0:13:43.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will he dare to refuse ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.04,0:13:47.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,With my Nascent Soul cultivation, I can kill him instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:51.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected, he's trying to trick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:55.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sorry Junior Brother Wu Yu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.40,0:13:56.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't save you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.96,0:13:58.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,nor let him send word of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:01.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,After entering Jue Ming Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.72,0:14:03.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will follow the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:11.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember: if you kill 5 enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will give your Soul Blood back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:15.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who try to flee
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:17.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,even just a thousand li
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:20.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,will have their Soul Blood crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:26.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Show those righteous cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:29.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,the might of our Corpse Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:43.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I planted a Divine Sense curse on him
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:46.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,but some mysterious entity erased it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:48.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I searched for days
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,but found no trace of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:53.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Teng,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:55.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,my divination showed me that he will be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,in Jue Ming Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.92,0:15:00.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to find his family ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:04.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough, fellow cultivator Teng.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:07.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Settle the score with the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why would you attack innocents ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:11.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Innocents ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.76,0:15:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Li'er was the Teng Family's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,most gifted Junior with exceptional talent !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:19.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that he's dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.08,0:15:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,, who will answer for it !?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.28,0:15:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if word of this gets out,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:27.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will ruin both our reputations !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.68,0:15:29.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Qiming,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as you agree to help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:36.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,this Soul Formation artifact, the Spirit Tortoise armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:38.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:07.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1398,505)\fad(300,300)}Jue Ming Valley\NCountry of Zhao
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:12.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must get the jade with my Soul Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It should be doable with my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:15.71,Third,,0,0,0,,What do we do now, Elder Mu Rong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.64,0:16:18.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mu Rong, act now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:20.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,We must seize Wang Lin's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:24.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must thank you all
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:28.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,for contributing to the Jue Ming battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:29.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elder Mu Rong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:30.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elder, what are you doing ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.96,0:16:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, my Soul Blood !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:42.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're dead !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:50.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Corpse Puppets are waking up,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:51.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,be careful !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.48,0:16:53.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is this purple mist !?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.68,0:17:05.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,All their puppets rebelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:23.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle, save me !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,You reap
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:25.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,what you sow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.65,0:19:46.53,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Country ranks are granted by the Cultivation Alliance. They correspond to the highest level cultivator there is in that specific country.\Nrank 1 = Foundation Establishment\Nrank 2 = Core Formation\Nrank 3 = Nascent Soul\Nrank 4 = Soul Formation\Nrank 5 = Soul Transformation\Nrank 6 = Ascendant\NRank 6 countries are given a planet by the Cultivation Alliance and they manage rank 5 countries. Rank 5 countries manage rank 4 countries and so on and so forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.16,0:17:55.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}I've been walking this path for endless years
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.81,0:17:55.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:18:01.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is it the compass of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:01.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that wrote this outcome for us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.56,0:18:07.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}The heavens want to erase your existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:13.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that's the obsession guiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:18.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is this the path to uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.20,0:18:18.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}truths from falsehoods ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:24.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}In a world of murk and shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:24.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}only the flame of truth can light the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.28,0:18:29.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.16,0:18:29.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}being carried by the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:34.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:34.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}being drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:37.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:41.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I will let the world refine my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:46.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.82,0:18:46.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.56,0:18:49.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I'll break through the abyss of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:52.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to finally learn who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.72,0:18:58.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.60,0:18:58.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I embrace this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.08,0:19:01.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:03.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}Even if this suffering shatters my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.84,0:19:09.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}and I'm reborn countless times in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.88,0:19:09.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}I'll still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:12.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It's hard to avoid loneliness
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.68,0:19:15.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}when you are above everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:21.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:21.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}be afraid of a firefly ?
